From fd5b763a5eb0c11655d91c77db16c9116bef1db7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:32:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/45] Send projectiles in the Specula feed

Feed format v10. A projectiles record before the turn record lists the
launches (point, target, speed, gravity, actor, impact actor and its
lifetime) and removals the turn made, in order. CCmpProjectileManager
records them before its graphics test, so a nonvisual observer gets
them too.

The projectile manager is not told who shoots, so the shooter is the
entity whose launch point Attack.js asked for right before the launch:
CCmpVisualActor::GetProjectileLaunchPoint notes it before its model
test.
